dsh-github-triage 0.1.0

This package is an original implementation, licensed under MIT (see LICENSE).

Implementation ideas were studied from:
- ItQianChen/dsh-github-flow — MIT
  https://github.com/ItQianChen/dsh-github-flow
  Studied gh credential reuse and repository review rule separation.
- PerryLink/dsh-github-bot — Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-github-bot
  Studied bounded read-only fetching, polling and PR-level evidence organization.

No source code snippets from either project were transplanted, copied or
modified into this package. No upstream NOTICE content is incorporated.
Their licenses continue to apply to their respective original projects.

Runtime dependencies are distributed separately by npm:
- undici (MIT) — https://github.com/nodejs/undici
- zod (MIT) — https://github.com/colinhacks/zod
Their distributed packages retain their own copyright and license notices.

Official DeepSeek Harness rc.5 packages are host peers/development dependencies.
Local monorepo package conventions were followed under this repository's MIT license.

